message: "If you use or adapt the Ihsan Codex, please cite it."
title: "The Ihsan Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as the Islamic ethic
  of craft and character — four virtues (Adab, Hikmah, Sidq, Sabr) under the crown
  of ihsan (excellence), each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Offered with
  respect. Part of a small family of conduct harnesses.
type: dataset
